☕ Kivaloop – Privacy Policy

Effective Date: October 18, 2025

Thank you for using Kivaloop (“we”, “our”, or “us”).
This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our mobile application (“App”) and related services.

1. Information We Collect

We may collect the following types of information:

a. Personal Information

When you register or use Kivaloop, we may collect:

Name and email address

Mobile number (optional)

Profile photo or display name

Location (for nearby coffee shops, if you allow)

b. Usage Information

We automatically collect information about how you use the app, including:

App interactions (ordering, spinning wheel, posting)

Device information (model, OS version, app version)

Log and analytics data (crash reports, performance statistics)

c. Media and Posts

When you share posts or favorite coffee moments, photos you upload are stored securely to display within the app’s community feed.

d. Location Data

If you choose to share your location, it helps us show nearby cafés or relevant offers.
You can disable location access anytime from your device settings.

2. How We Use Your Information

We use collected data to:

Process coffee orders and manage payments (where applicable)

Operate user profiles and display posts

Provide rewards and game-related features (like the spin wheel)

Improve app functionality and fix bugs

Send updates, offers, or important notifications (only with your consent)

3. How We Share Your Information

We do not sell your personal data.
We may share information only with:

Service providers (e.g., Firebase, Supabase) who help us run the app

Legal authorities, if required by law

Other users, when you post content publicly within the Kivaloop community

4. Data Security

We use secure cloud services and encryption protocols to protect your data.
However, no online platform can guarantee 100% security. You are responsible for keeping your login credentials safe.

5. Your Rights

You may:

Access, update, or delete your account data

Withdraw consent to share data (like location or notifications)

Request complete data deletion by contacting us

6. Children’s Privacy

Kivaloop is not intended for users under 13 years old.
We do not knowingly collect personal data from minors.

7. Third-Party Services

Kivaloop integrates third-party tools and SDKs, including:

Firebase (Google) – for authentication, analytics, and notifications

Supabase – for data and vector storage

Stripe (if applicable) – for payments

Each of these services has its own privacy policy.

8. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally.
Any changes will be posted here with the updated “Effective Date.”

9. Contact Us

If you have any questions or requests about your data, please contact us:
